# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# school-erp-blueprint — strict ignore list
# Defence-in-depth: the staged research was already vetted clean,
# but these patterns prevent sensitive or proprietary material from
# ever being committed in future.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets & credentials ──
*.env
.env*
*.pem
*.key
*.ppk
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
*.crt
*.cer
id_rsa*
*apikey*
*api_key*
*.secret
secrets.*
credentials.*
*.credentials
service-account*.json
*.token
auth_token*
access_token*
refresh_token*

# ── Cookies / sessions / browser-debug identifiers ──
*.cookie
cookies*.txt
*cookies*.json
*devtools*
*webSocketDebugger*
*ws-endpoint*
*browser-debug*
cdp-*.json

# ── Raw network / session captures ──
*.har
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.saz
raw_capture*/
*_raw_capture*

# ── Proprietary application source / shipped bundles ──
# (No such files are committed; this blocks accidental future adds.)
*.js
*.mjs
*.cjs
*.jsx
*.ts
*.tsx
*.map
*.min.js
*.bundle.js
assets/**/*.js
app_bundles/
js_corpus/

# ── Build output / dependencies / temp / scratch ──
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.cache/
coverage/
tmp/
temp/
scratch/
scratchpad/
*.tmp
*.log
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.venv/
venv/

# ── OS / editor cruft ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# NOTE ON IMAGES: image files are NOT globally ignored because the
# curated, manually-redacted screenshots under
# 01_EDUVATE_RESEARCH/09_VISUAL_EVIDENCE/ are intentional research
# evidence. Any NEW screenshot must be visually confirmed redacted
# (no student/employee PII, no faces, no IDs) before it is added.
